{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17989","headline":"赠唐衢 · 韩愈","name":"赠唐衢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虎有爪兮牛有角，虎可搏兮牛可触。\n奈何君独抱奇材，手把锄犁饿空谷。\n当今天子急贤良，匦函朝出开明光。\n胡不上书自荐达，坐令四海如虞唐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}